{"abstract":"The paper was an accompaniment of an artefact critique submissions at NordiCHI 2022. If you want to stay up to date with the project, either visit the solar server itself at https:solar.itu.dk (sometimes not available due to lack of energy) or read about it on the Ethos Lab blog","author_count":1,"contributors":["Landa Mariaca, Luis Alfredo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384048"],"filters":{"added":"2023-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Computing","LIMITS","Low tech","Solar","no tech","within"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a diy solar server and the challenges and provocations of attempting to decarbonise our lab s website","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/93183274/paper_preprint.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-384048","identifier":[{"id":"85140921948","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-bdcee478-9945-44c3-8e69-49ab33048226"],"keyword":["computing","limits","low tech","no tech","solar","within"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5588F113EDABDF9ADF808B46545D4D82"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/93183274/paper_preprint.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Luis Alfredo","key":"landamariacapau","last":"Landa